section.t:
In this document a service is functionality performed as a result of a network connection
from an initator to a responder. The service is commonly named after the role name of the responder,
such as Join Proxy, registrar or MASA.

Each entry registers a Service Name intended for discovery of a BRSKI related service 
using a specific Discovery Mechanism. The service is to be accessed via specific service (transport) stack Parameter(s)
that are required to be known by the discovery mechanism.
